  "topic": "folding_range",
  "subtopic": "conditionals",
  "title": "Untaken branches",
  "summary": "Untaken branches fold like taken ones",
  "prose": "Every branch of a conditional folds whether or not the compile takes it,\nconditionals nested in an untaken branch included, so dead code can be\nfolded away by hand. Untaken code is dimmed by the `inactive` modifier of\nsemantic tokens; the folds themselves do not tell the branches apart.",
